id: keyboard-keys
section: Keyboard and text
item: A hardware keyboard's non-printing keys reach the page (the echo page's readout): Enter fires change, Left and Backspace, Home and Delete edit at the caret, Tab moves the focus from a field to the next, Up and Down move between a textarea's lines (Tab inside a textarea inserts a tab there instead of moving on: a finding, not this script's check)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-input-echo.html
kit: cavekit-input-bridging.md R2
fixture: kernel-kbd
wait rect plain 20
calibrate 'sel:#plain'
tap plain
expect keyboard up
pause 1500
kernel-key 30
kernel-key 48
wait text echo 'plain n=2 c=0 last=[ab] value=[ab]' 5
kernel-key 28
wait text echo 'plain n=2 c=1' 5
kernel-key 105
kernel-key 14
wait text echo 'plain n=3 c=1 last=[b] value=[b]' 5
kernel-key 106
kernel-key 30
kernel-key 102
kernel-key 111
wait text echo 'plain n=5 c=1 last=[a] value=[a]' 5
kernel-key 15
wait text echo 'focus=area' 5
kernel-key 30
kernel-key 28
kernel-key 48
kernel-key 28
kernel-key 46
wait text echo 'area n=5' 5
kernel-key 103
kernel-key 103
kernel-key 111
wait text echo 'area n=6' 5
kernel-key 108
kernel-key 14
kernel-key 14
wait text echo 'area n=8 c=0 last=[ab] value=[ab]' 5
